#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:5
#: data/pkg/desktop/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.desktop.in:4
#, fuzzy
msgid "A tiling terminal for Linux, forked from Tilix"
msgstr "गनोम के लिए एक टाइलिंग टर्मिनल"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:9
msgid ""
"Kumiko is an actively maintained fork of Tilix, the tiling terminal emulator "
"for Linux. It keeps Tilix's tiling model — split terminals horizontally or "
"vertically, nest them arbitrarily, save and restore layouts — and adds a "
"focus on security hardening for people who spend the day on remote shells."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:12
msgid ""
"Kumiko is built on ttyx_ by gwelr, itself a fork of Tilix by Gerald Nunn."
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:13
msgid "It lets you:"
msgstr "यह आपको:"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:15
msgid ""
"Layout terminals in any fashion by splitting them horizontally or vertically"
msgstr "टर्मिनलों को क्षैतिज या लंबवत रूप से विभाजित करके किसी भी प्रकार से अभिन्यास करें"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:16
msgid ""
"Terminals can be re-arranged using drag and drop both within and between "
"windows"
msgstr ""
"विंडो के भीतर और बीच दोनों जगह ड्रैग और ड्रॉप का उपयोग करके टर्मिनलों को फिर से "
"व्यवस्थित किया जा सकता है"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:17
msgid "Terminals can be detached into a new window via drag and drop"
msgstr "टर्मिनलों को ड्रैग और ड्रॉप के माध्यम से एक नई विंडो में अलग किया जा सकता है"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:18
msgid ""
"Input can be synchronized between terminals so commands typed in one "
"terminal are replicated to the others"
msgstr ""
"इनपुट को टर्मिनलों के बीच समन्वयित किया जा सकता है ताकि एक टर्मिनल में टाइप किए गए "
"कमांड को दूसरे टर्मिनल पर दोहराया जा सके"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:20
msgid "The grouping of terminals can be saved and loaded from disk"
msgstr "टर्मिनलों के समूहन को डिस्क से सहेजा और लोड किया जा सकता है"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:21
msgid "Terminals support custom titles"
msgstr "टर्मिनल तदनुकूल शीर्षकों का समर्थन करते हैं"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:22
msgid ""
"Color schemes are stored in files and custom color schemes can be created by "
"simply creating a new file"
msgstr ""
"रंग योजनाएं फाइलों में संग्रहीत की जाती हैं और तदनुकूल रंग योजनाएं केवल एक नई फाइल बनाकर "
"बनाई जा सकती हैं"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:24
msgid "Transparent background"
msgstr "पारदर्शी पृष्ठभूमि"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:25
msgid "Supports notifications when processes are completed out of view"
msgstr "जब प्रक्रियाएं दृश्य से बाहर पूरी हो जाती हैं तो भी सूचनाओं का समर्थन करता है"

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:46
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:80
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:106
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:149
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:180
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:212
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:48
msgid ""
"ttyx_ is now Kumiko: new name, command (kumiko), app ID "
"(io.github.iqzer0.kumiko) and repository. Settings, sessions and saved "
"passwords from ttyx_ carry over on first run, as do Tilix sessions and "
"passwords"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:51
msgid ""
"Packages for the major distributions: .deb for Ubuntu and Debian, .rpm for "
"Fedora and openSUSE, and AUR packages for Arch, each installed and launched "
"on a clean image of every supported release before it ships"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:54
msgid ""
"Signed package repositories (kumiko-packages, see the install guide) keep "
"Kumiko updated with apt, dnf and zypper"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:56
msgid ""
"The paste review appears only when a paste could run something: programs "
"with bracketed paste (zsh, bash 5.1+, fish) and single lines with a trailing "
"newline paste straight in"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:58
msgid ""
"New profile option \"Mouse wheel sends arrow keys in full-screen programs\", "
"off by default, so a tab left on the alternate screen no longer types ^[OA "
"into commands"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:61
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:90
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:119
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:170
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:189
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:227
msgid "Bugfixes"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:63
msgid ""
"Kumiko starts on systems without gsettings-desktop-schemas (minimal "
"installs, some non-GNOME desktops) instead of aborting"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:65
msgid "kumiko --version works without a display"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:66
msgid ""
"Wayland is detected reliably under compositors started from a TTY, such as "
"sway and Hyprland"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:67
msgid ""
"Passwords saved by Tilix were listed but could not be used; they work now, "
"as do ttyx_ ones"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:69
msgid ""
"Test code was linked into the application and initialised GTK before startup"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:71
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:97
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:136
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:197
#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:233
msgid "Miscellaneous"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:73
msgid ""
"Continuous integration builds, tests and launches Kumiko under X11 and "
"Wayland on Ubuntu 22.04/24.04/26.04, Debian 12/13/testing, Fedora, Arch "
"Linux and openSUSE Tumbleweed/Leap"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:82
msgid ""
"The application is now built on the actively-maintained giD bindings "
"(gid:gtk3 / gid:vte2) instead of the unmaintained GtkD, completing ROADMAP "
"Phase 2a; runtime behaviour is intended to be identical, and this beta's "
"validation period exists to prove exactly that"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:85
msgid ""
"The unsafe-paste alert (dangerous-command patterns in pasted text) now ships "
"default-off — it interrupted legitimate admin pastes more than it protected; "
"enable it under Preferences -> Global -> Clipboard. The always-on "
"protections stand: bracketed-paste escape stripping and the multi-line paste "
"review remain enabled by default"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:92
msgid ""
"Remote 'ttyx -a <action>' invocations executed their action but hung instead "
"of exiting immediately"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:94
msgid ""
"Release builds with plain ldc2 failed on a DMD-only -inline flag; this also "
"kept CI red since the build swap"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:99
msgid "Dub is now the single build system; Meson is retired"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:100
msgid ""
"Flatpak packaging dropped — building from source is the supported "
"distribution channel"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:108
msgid ""
"OSC 11 dynamic background color — apps like neovim and theme-switching "
"scripts can now change the terminal background at runtime via the OSC 11 "
"escape sequence; reset with OSC 111"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:110
msgid ""
"enable-wide-handle defaults to true so the splitter between split terminals "
"is easier to see and grab on dark themes and HiDPI displays"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:112
msgid "Auto-equalize panes on split and close, sway-style"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:113
msgid ""
"A published documentation site covering install, the manual, security "
"reference, migration guide and changelog (linked from the project homepage; "
"a bare URL here trips AppStream's description-has-plaintext-url validation)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:116
msgid ""
"Sensitive values redaction: passwords, tokens and proxy credentials are "
"stripped from trace logs, command-line argv and hyperlink click events "
"before reaching any log sink"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:121
msgid ""
"Maximized terminal now correctly restores when loading a saved session; "
"fixes a long-standing bug pre-existing since the upstream Tilix 2017 "
"implementation"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:123
msgid ""
"Trigger templates: $0 now correctly substitutes the whole match (was shifted "
"by one due to a size_t underflow); user templates relying on the bugged "
"behaviour need indices shifted up by one"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:126
msgid ""
"Triggers with an unrecognised action name are now skipped with a warning "
"instead of silently rewritten to UpdateState"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:128
msgid ""
"Paste hardening: strip OSC, DCS, APC and PM escape sequences from clipboard "
"content before paste"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:130
msgid "Robust /proc/[pid]/stat parser with bounds validation"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:131
msgid ""
"Password manager delete now correctly reports keyring failures and handles "
"legacy Tilix-schema entries"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:133
msgid ""
"Proxy URL builder: percent-encode userinfo and drop the redundant leading @; "
"HTTPS proxy now receives credentials when configured"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:138
msgid "First beta of the 1.2.0 release; validation period before GA"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:139
msgid ""
"Internal refactors using D SumType for compile-time exhaustiveness: "
"TerminalRegex (BuiltinRegex/CustomRegex), SyncInputEvent, and a typed "
"TerminalSnapshot struct as the single source of truth for session "
"serialisation"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:142
msgid ""
"CI: install LDC from the upstream tarball; build GtkD from source on Debian "
"Testing where the apt package was removed"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:151
msgid ""
"Security: restored sessions now ask for confirmation before running an "
"embedded per-terminal command, instead of executing it silently on load"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:153
msgid ""
"Security: custom-link and trigger commands shell-quote all substituted match "
"tokens and terminal variables, closing a shell-injection hole in values "
"drawn from terminal output or remote-settable OSC variables"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:156
msgid ""
"Security: paste sanitization is now applied on every paste path; the default "
"path previously fell through to pasting the raw clipboard text"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:158
msgid ""
"Security: bracketed-paste escape stripping loops to a fixed point so split "
"or overlapping markers cannot reassemble after removal"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:160
msgid ""
"Security: carriage return now counts as a command submitter in the paste "
"safety checks, matching newline handling"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:162
msgid ""
"Security: OSC 8 hyperlinks are restricted to an allow-listed set of URI "
"schemes before being handed to the desktop URI handler"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:164
msgid ""
"Security: trigger regex matching input is bounded as defense-in-depth "
"against catastrophic-backtracking UI hangs on adversarial output"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:166
msgid ""
"Security: spawn-failure logs redact proxy credentials; log redaction covers "
"more sensitive key names and strips URL userinfo from all values"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:168
msgid "Security: retrieved keyring passwords are kept in non-pageable memory"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:172
msgid "Crash reading the host shell from a malformed passwd entry (Flatpak)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:173
msgid "Crash loading a session file with a corrupt paned orientation value"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:174
msgid "Crash reading a child process name from a malformed /proc stat entry"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:182
msgid ""
"Automatic config migration from Tilix — on first run, ~/.config/tilix/ is "
"copied to ~/.config/ttyx/ with the original kept as backup"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:184
msgid ""
"Password manager reads legacy com.gexperts.tilix.Password schema for "
"backwards compatibility; new passwords are saved under the ttyx schema"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:186
msgid ""
"TTYX_ID environment variable set in shells alongside TILIX_ID for backwards "
"compatibility with existing shell integrations"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:191
msgid ""
"Color scheme loader no longer shows duplicates; user config now wins over "
"system defaults when a scheme filename exists in both"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:193
msgid ""
"Post-install script writes a minimal index.theme at the install prefix so "
"gtk-update-icon-cache can generate a valid icon cache"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:195
msgid "AppStream metadata no longer includes stale Tilix release entries"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:199
msgid ""
"Rename user-visible Tilix references: Nautilus menu, shortcuts window, "
"GSettings descriptions, icon filenames, log and temp paths"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:201
msgid ""
"Rewrite man page under ttyx_ identity; drop 30 stale translations that "
"referenced Tilix-branded msgids"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:203
msgid ""
"Release process simplified: drop hand-assembled binary tarball, ship only "
"Flatpak bundle with signed checksums"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:205
msgid "Add Troubleshooting section to README (stale icon cache, Wayland Quake)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:206
msgid "Add ROADMAP.md documenting vision and phase plan"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:214
msgid "Security: enforce in-memory-only scrollback, capped at 256-999999 lines"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:215
msgid "Security: core dump protection via prctl PR_SET_DUMPABLE"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:216
msgid "Security: Secure Clear action (Ctrl+Shift+L) to wipe scrollback buffer"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:217
msgid ""
"Security: SSH session detection indicator for ssh, scp, sftp, mosh, sshfs"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:218
msgid "Security: clipboard auto-clear after configurable timeout"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:219
msgid "Security: strip bracketed paste escape sequences to prevent injection"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:220
msgid "Security: multi-line paste review dialog before execution"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:221
msgid ""
"Security: expanded dangerous command detection (sudo, rm -rf, curl|bash, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:222
msgid "Security: per-paste unsafe warning (no longer permanently dismissed)"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:223
msgid ""
"Security: all options consolidated in Advanced preferences with descriptions"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:224
msgid "Flatpak packaging with GNOME 48 SDK and bundled LDC compiler"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:225
msgid "ProcessMonitor optimization: idle CPU reduced from 1.4% to 0.1%"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:229
msgid "Fix GC crash when opening preferences on GLib 2.84+"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:230
msgid "Fix SSH and root indicators not clearing when process exits"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:231
msgid "Fix color scheme test when schemes not installed in XDG paths"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:235
msgid "Major terminal.d decomposition into extracted components"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:236
msgid "Replace applyPreference switch with PreferenceRegistry pattern"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:237
msgid "119 unit tests covering security, clipboard, rendering, and monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: data/metainfo/io.github.iqzer0.kumiko.appdata.xml.rel.in:238
msgid "CI: add xvfb support for GTK integration tests"
msgstr ""

